The company also offers test and evaluation services and runs technology transfer programmes for international clients. Its products are presented as tailored to demanding operating conditions, and the company works through the transfer of skills to build local capability rather than supplying only finished equipment. It suits defence, security and humanitarian organisations looking for a partner to acquire and build vehicles and systems locally, and the warehouse is on Brander Street in Jan Niemand Park, Pretoria.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.twiga-africa.com/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'twiga-warehouse-jan-niemand-park' AND description = 'Twiga Warehouse is a facility of Twiga, a South African defence and security engineering company that has provided turnkey armoured-vehicle, patrol-boat and weapon-mount acquisition projects to defence, security and humanitarian clients for more than 30 years.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
